# Customer-domain assets moved to a PRIVATE repo (2026-08-19) — case-
# classification plan, customer taxonomy, spine builder + outputs. The repo
# name is deliberately NOT named here or in AGENTS.md: this file is public, and
# naming the customer in a public portfolio is a confidentiality problem
# independent of the assets themselves. Ignore defensively so accidental
# regeneration/mirroring never lands here:
/spine/
/scripts/build_spine.py
/scripts/seed_spine.sh

# MemorySteward private IP docs (2026-08-21) — the Steward architecture,
# harness audit, state mapping, the Governed Diagnostic Loop, port specs,
# rubric pin. Live in the PRIVATE repo brain-steward-ip; never commit here.
/docs/ARCHITECTURE_steward.md
/docs/HARNESS_G0_AUDIT.md
/docs/WORKFLOW_STATE_MAPPING.md
/docs/WORKFLOW_TROUBLESHOOTING.md
/docs/port-spec-*.md
/docs/rubric-pin-*.md
/docs/STEWARD_COMPLIANCE.md

