.fastembed_cache/

# Rerank/classify model artifacts — downloaded from HuggingFace (see PLAN_06), never committed
/models/
EXECUTION_PROMPT_*.md
audit-chain.key

# dep-research scratch (crate extraction) — never commit
.depcheck/

# plugin-sync baseline (scripts/sync-plugin.sh) — local drift-guard state, never commit
/.plugin-sync-baseline

# AGENTS.md is deliberately NOT ignored. It is tracked and published (added
# 64abca7; the same blob is in both origin/main and public/main), and public
# source cites it as its authority (src/workflow/channels.rs:19,
# src/workflow/delivery.rs:4151, client/src/main.rs:23) — so it is
# load-bearing, not hidden. An earlier `/AGENTS.md` rule here was INERT:
# .gitignore never applies to an already-tracked file, so it asserted a
# protection the repo did not have. Re-adding the rule would recreate the
# same false control.

